msgid "Moving placed buildings"
msgstr "Moving placed buildings"

msgid "Gizmo"
msgstr "Gizmo"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Enabled"

msgid "Move arrows for placed buildings in the developer build mode (Shift+F12)."
msgstr "Move arrows for placed buildings in the developer build mode (Shift+F12)."

msgid "Not while placing a new building"
msgstr "Not while placing a new building"

msgid "A click then places the building instead of grabbing an arrow. Turn off only if the arrows never appear."
msgstr "A click then places the building instead of grabbing an arrow. Turn off only if the arrows never appear."

msgid "Write the move into the building"
msgstr "Write the move into the building"

msgid "Only if a building moves on screen but the move is not saved."
msgstr "Only if a building moves on screen but the move is not saved."

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostics"

msgid "Detailed log"
msgstr "Detailed log"

msgid "Details in RE_Kenshi_log.txt."
msgstr "Details in RE_Kenshi_log.txt."

msgid "Move arrows for already placed buildings in the developer build mode."
msgstr "Move arrows for already placed buildings in the developer build mode."

msgid "Only if a building moves on screen but the move is not saved. Usually the game does it itself."
msgstr "Only if a building moves on screen but the move is not saved. Usually the game does it itself."

msgid "Details in RE_Kenshi_log.txt: who called the arrows this frame - the game or the plugin, the selection and the transform window."
msgstr "Details in RE_Kenshi_log.txt: who called the arrows this frame - the game or the plugin, the selection and the transform window."

msgid "Move arrows on your construction site: shift a placed building before it is built, without the developer menu."
msgstr "Move arrows on your construction site: shift a placed building before it is built, without the developer menu."

msgid "Construction sites"
msgstr "Construction sites"

msgid "Turns the whole plugin on or off."
msgstr "Turns the whole plugin on or off."

msgid "Arrows on your construction site"
msgstr "Arrows on your construction site"

msgid "Select your building that is not built yet: move arrows appear on it. Drag an arrow to shift it, the window button switches to rotation. Close the window to hide them."
msgstr "Select your building that is not built yet: move arrows appear on it. Drag an arrow to shift it, the window button switches to rotation. Close the window to hide them."

msgid "Developer menu"
msgstr "Developer menu"

msgid "Arrows in the developer build mode"
msgstr "Arrows in the developer build mode"

msgid "The first version: arrows in the normal build mode of the developer menu (Shift+F12). Experimental, off by default."
msgstr "The first version: arrows in the normal build mode of the developer menu (Shift+F12). Experimental, off by default."

msgid "A click then places the building instead of grabbing an arrow. Developer menu only."
msgstr "A click then places the building instead of grabbing an arrow. Developer menu only."

msgid "Developer menu only: if a building moves on screen but the move is not saved."
msgstr "Developer menu only: if a building moves on screen but the move is not saved."

msgid "Details in RE_Kenshi_log.txt: when the arrows open and close and where the building moved."
msgstr "Details in RE_Kenshi_log.txt: when the arrows open and close and where the building moved."

msgid "Settle on the ground after a move"
msgstr "Settle on the ground after a move"

msgid "When the arrow is released, the building is rebuilt where it now stands, and the game puts it on the ground. Off - it stays at the height you raised it to."
msgstr "When the arrow is released, the building is rebuilt where it now stands, and the game puts it on the ground. Off - it stays at the height you raised it to."
